<title>DUBAI: Saudi Hollandi Bank profit rises in Q1.</title>
<headline>Saudi Hollandi Bank profit rises in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million Saudi riyals unless stated)</p>
<p> Net  profit		 46.8	     vs    34.7</p>
<p> Net operating income    44.0	     vs    30.2</p>
<p> Customer deposits	 11.38  billion vs    10.75 billion</p>
<p> Assets			17.28  billion  vs   16.45 billion</p>
<p>Full Name - Saudi Hollandi Bank.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based bank is 40 percent owned by the Dutch ABN-Amro. The rest is held by Saudi investors.</p>
</text>
